description.p:
0.4.39: AppImage ships a root PNG so file managers get .DirIcon;
mixed-mode / CD-Extra .bin data tracks are saved with lossless
output only (not into Also-encode lossy folders).

0.4.38: QAAC Also-encode; Encoded by always names the codec tool;
Ripper tag comment; separate lossy/lossless embed sizes (no loose
cover beside lossy); lyrics save mode (embed / sidecar / both);
smoother settings expanders; AppImage / deb / rpm packaging only.

0.4.36: Primary rip lossless-only; Also encode lossy companions;
LRCLIB lyrics (lossless tags + sidecars); settings UI cleanup;
lossless embed artwork option; 100 MB art limit; metadata cache prune.

0.4.33: Encoded by tag on by default (Tags preference to disable);
continuous whole-rip progress; custom naming fields only when
Custom… is selected.

Secure archival rip and stock FLAC/MP3/Opus/AAC encode;
in-app CD playback with seek and next-track wrap; MusicBrainz
retry / clearer FreeDB errors; README screenshot refresh.

MusicBrainz release-link lookup when auto-match is wrong;
smarter burst fallback (one CRC retry, then full-disc burst re-rip);
archival rip log with accurate CRC/mode/session history; Lookup menu;
pill Eject/Rip styling; bottom progress panel polish.
